legend right
  |= Color |= Meaning |
  |<#EEEEEE>   | Existing code (studied during concept location) |
  |<#FFE0B2>   | Modified by this issue |
  |<#C8E6C9>   | New in this issue |
  Dashed arrow = dependency (uses)
  Solid arrow = association (holds a reference)
  Filled diamond = composition (owns)
endlegend

